**Current Code:**
```kotlin
// Lines 66-81 (addBudget)
when (result) {
    is com.yourname.expensetracker.domain.model.Result.Success -> {
        _manualState.value = ManualState.Idle
    }
    is com.yourname.expensetracker.domain.model.Result.Error -> {
