/**
 * Abstraction for system time to enable deterministic testing.
 * 
 * Usage:
 * - Production: Inject SystemTimeProvider
 * - Tests: Inject FakeTimeProvider with fixed time
 * 
 * Benefits:
 * - Mockable time for unit tests
 * - Centralized time access
